WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.940
Guys like this only have three options

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:10.220
Dying, life in prison, or they start talking.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.520
Not on our American soil!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.740
Make them leave!

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.880
This is our last gig.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:18.460
Why?

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.120
I don't want my kids to be around this.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.440
Hey Punks!

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.500
What'cha looking at?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.360
You.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.600
We don't tolerate stupidity.

00:00:35.608 --> 00:00:36.179
Got that?

00:00:36.179 --> 00:00:38.179
Yes sir!

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.420
Do you have one that you regret?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.080
Some of 'em.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.620
Why, you got one you regret?

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.500
What was your first one?

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.480
Fred gave it to me.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.820
He took me in.

00:00:47.826 --> 00:00:48.595
I owe him.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.760
I think real family don't make you owe shit.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.340
So, you're a family man now,

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.680
listen, talk to me perhaps.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.580
You know the bikies ain't gonna like it!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.280
You're better than those racists.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.560
I don't know what to do.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.740
In this business,

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.580
you gotta stay focused.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.000
Or fall.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.480
Right down the rabbit hole.

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.260
What if I take all this stuff off and 
I am still a piece of shit?

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.860
You have an out, right?

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.640
I can help you.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.120
You don't answer your phone.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.080
You don't show up for meetings anymore.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.160
I don't even know if you are a member.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.980
I don't know what they're gonna do.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.900
You need to get the kids and get out of here.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:38.520
It's time for you to come back home.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.500
I am now going back.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.600
No, you have no choice.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.000
This is my family!

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.060
You're still breathing because I own you.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.220
And every inch of ink on you.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.060
Is it true what Desi said?

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:04.180
That you're an evil man.

